<p>To complete the sidequest, return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node and give the Flower Bud to the girl on the first floor to advance the [A Flower of Promise] sidequest.  Skip to the &quot;A New Mission&quot; node and talk to her again to complete the [A Flower of Promise] sidequest and receive a THAUMATECH ORB (MAG+5/MDF+5). Return to &quot;The Beastkind Forest&quot; node and head up to talk to Rosch.</p>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Unacceptable Loss">
<p>[Gauntlet node] You will then receive your next mission from Patriarch Barranca.  Aht and Gafka will then join your party.</p>
</Callout>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Beastkind&#x27;s Favor">
<p>Equip the Rhapsody on Aht and Rune Claw on Gafka.  Then, buy a Leather Cuirass for Gafka and buy a Reinforced Cape for Aht.  At this point, I like keeping extra accessories around for different situations, and we have more money than we need, anyway.  Buy 4 Horn Charms, 3 Fang Charms, and 5 Bishop Studs.  I prefer defensive accessories on her on Aht for non-boss encounters, despite her Traps being magic-based, since they&#x27;re already more than powerful enough, and she is rather frail.  Stocke will need to be ready to use magic for the next area, so I like giving him magic-boosting accessories, while keeping Fang Charms in reserve.  I&#x27;d also buy 5 Curse &amp; Sleep Wings at the item shop.</p>
</Callout>

<p>Go up to the Boundary Tree and search the left side for a hidden chest which contains 2 ANTI-PARALYTICS.  Leave the village via the south entrance, and search the left side for a hidden chest which contains 3000 G. When you are ready, leave Celestia and head for Lazvil Hills.</p>

<Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
<p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>Stocke: Rune Edge, Heavy Mail, Crystal Charm, Thaumatech Orb, Horn Charm<br/>Aht: Rhapsody, Reinforced Cape, Bishop Stud x3<br/>Gafka: Rune Claw, Leather Cuirass, Fang Charm x3<br/>Extra: Bishop Stud x2, Fang Charm x3, Horn Charm x3</p>
</Callout>

<p>=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=</p>
