<p>******************************************************************************* BOSS TIME: Forest Bear, Stompy x2 WEAKNESS: Ice, Fire STRATEGY: These monsters aren&#x27;t a real threat, but your turn queue is probably screwed up.  Aht should start by laying an Ice Trap for later.  However, your first priority should be to take out the two Stompys, before they can summon more help.  A Push Assault from Gafka and Fire spell from Stocke will do the trick.  Push the Forest Bear onto the Ice Trap.  Then, use the Change command once to get enough turns to finish off the Forest Bear with two more Ice Traps. *******************************************************************************</p>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Report from Vanoss">
<p>You&#x27;ll briefly return to Celestia.  After talking to Barranca, head to the inn to talk to Vanoss, and depart for Alistel.</p>
</Callout>

<Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
<p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>Stocke: Rune Edge, Heavy Mail, Fang Charm x3<br/>Aht: Rhapsody, Reinforced Cape, Bishop Stud x3<br/>Gafka: Rune Claw, Leather Cuirass, Fang Charm x3<br/>Extra: Bishop Stud x2, Crystal Charm, Thaumatech Orb, Horn Charm x4</p>
</Callout>

<p>=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=</p>
