<p>Head up, and Vanoss will arrive.</p>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Darkness in Alistel">
<p>Talk to Vanoss again to receive the [Wandering Soul] sidequest.  Go up to the Second Ward, and climb the left stairs to the upper left.  Talk to the woman above to receive the [Second Opinion] sidequest.  Outside the weapon shop, on the right side of the Second Ward, is a boy to whom you can talk to receive the [Battlefield Missive] sidequest.  You should buy a Sorcery Epee for Stocke and a Magic Spear for Raynie from the shop.  Finally, return to the castle north to proceed with the plot.</p>
</Callout>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Reunion with Raul">
<p>After the meeting, I would continue using Aht and Gafka, and arrange your party as follow.  Then, attempt to leave Alistel.</p>
</Callout>

<Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
<p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>Stocke: Sorcery Epee, Heavy Mail, Fang Charm x3<br/>Raynie: Magic Spear, Heavy Mail, Horn Charm x3<br/>Marco: Wisp Blade, Heavy Mail, Bishop Stud x3<br/>Aht: Rhapsody, Reinforced Cape, Crystal Charm, Thaumatech Orb, Horn Charm<br/>Gafka: Rune Claw, Leather Cuirass, Fang Charm x3<br/>Extra: Bishop Stud x3, Horn Charm x3</p>
</Callout>

<p>******************************************************************************* BOSS TIME: Shadow x3 WEAKNESS: None STRATEGY: Aht should lead with Polaris to protect against their Paralysis attack.  They may try to complete a formation, in which case, you should break it up with an assault.  Otherwise, two of any trap will kill them.  If you can, try to get two of them on a single trap to finish them off even more quickly. *******************************************************************************</p>

<p>Unless Raynie hasn&#x27;t reached Level 30 yet to learn G-Fire, I would recommend keeping Aht around and equipping her with the Bishop Studs again.  Fight the soldiers on your way out of Alistel, head to Lazvil Hills, and follow the same path you took back to Celestia.</p>

<Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
<p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>Stocke: Sorcery Epee, Heavy Mail, Horn Charm x3<br/>Raynie: Magic Spear, Heavy Mail, Crystal Charm, Thaumatech Orb, Horn Charm<br/>Marco: Wisp Blade, Heavy Mail, Bishop Stud x3<br/>Aht: Rhapsody, Reinforced Cape, Bishop Stud x3<br/>Gafka: Rune Claw, Leather Cuirass, Fang Charm x3<br/>Extra: Fang Charm x3, Horn Charm x3</p>
</Callout>

<p>=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=</p>
