<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Successful Infiltration">
<p>Eerily enough, there are no enemies around the palace.  Walk left, up the stairs, and into the Meeting Room to the right.  On the right side is a hidden chest which contains 2000 G.  Go back down the stairs and left two rooms to the Training Area where you will see a save point.  In the lower left corner is a hidden chest which contains 2000 G. Head up to the save point to advance the plot and climb the vines to do so again.</p>
</Callout>

<p>******************************************************************************* BOSS TIME: Blue Granorg Archer x3, Granorg Defender x3 WEAKNESS: None STRATEGY: These guys seem to really screw up the turn order to prevent combos, so make heavy use of the Change command.  First, have Marco cast Magic Boost on Raynie.  She can one-shot the Archers with any spell, but you&#x27;ll need G-Fire to one-shot the Defenders, or an Assault plus any spell.  Depending on the turn order, defeat any two of them with an Assault and a spell from Raynie.  Try to kill the ones that are breaking up your combos, if you can.  Otherwise, just keep taking them out two at a time.  You won&#x27;t need to heal. *******************************************************************************</p>

<p>You&#x27;ll need to retreat the way you came, fighting soldiers along the way, until you make it back to the Underground Passage.  This time, you can move around freely here.  Follow the hall up to a fork, where you should first go left to the Underground Library to find a chest which contains a COCKTAIL DRESS (DEF+6/MDF+15, sell).  Then, take the right path at the fork to escape.</p>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Princess of Light">
<p>After some dialogue, you will return to Granorg.</p>
</Callout>

<p>=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=</p>
