<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: The Resistance">
<p>After some more dialogue, talk to Will at the bar to unlock the [Sand Sword] node.  While not a mandatory event for now, you will eventually have to do it. Head east to the Downtown area.  Somewhat hidden by a tree in the center, you will find Eruca in her cloak, and she will prompt you for a decision.  Choosing &quot;Don&#x27;t push yourself&quot; will unlock [Princess&#x27; Charge] ending.  Otherwise, choosing &quot;Fulfill your duty&quot; will advance [The King&#x27;s Daughter] sidequest.</p>
</Callout>

<p>Go east and north one screen.  Talk to the woman in pink to receive the [Despairing Young Man] sidequest.  Head south and east one screen, and check out the shops with new wares for sale.  I would buy a Soul Eater for Stocke and a Bloody Pike for Rosch later.  The Soul Eater is great for Stocke&#x27;s physical attacks, but you should hold onto his Sorcery Epee for when you want him to be casting magic instead.</p>

<p>Return to the &quot;To Granorg&quot; node.  Talk to Anna in the upper left corner of the Second Ward to complete [The King&#x27;s Daughter] sidequest and to receive the RABBIT&#x27;S FOOT (MP+10/LUC+15).  The Luck stat improves your stealing ability, so you may want to hold onto it for later, but it&#x27;s not critical at all.</p>

<p>Return to the &quot;Castle Sewers&quot; node and head up to the Palace-Front Plaza.  Talk to the man in the cloak to advance the [Despairing Young Man] sidequest. Return to &quot;The Resistance&quot; node and talk to him again to complete the [Despairing Young Man] sidequest and receive the LEFT-CUT SCROLL for Marco, which you should teach to him immediately.</p>

<p>Leave Granorg and head to the Gran Plain to reach Cornet Village.</p>

<Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
<p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>Stocke: Soul Eater, Heavy Mail, Fang Charm x3<br/>Raynie: Magic Spear, Heavy Mail, Crystal Charm, Thaumatech Orb, Horn Charm<br/>Marco: Wisp Blade, Heavy Mail, Bishop Stud x3<br/>Extra: Sorcery Epee, Bloody Pike, Horn Charm x6</p>
</Callout>

